{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro arcade shooter inspired by classic 80's games</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blast through relentless waves of enemies in this fast-paced side-scrolling shoot \u2019em up. Pilot your ship across looping battlefields, dodge swarms of bullets, and unleash devastating firepower while protecting vital ground targets. Tight controls, explosive combat, and arcade-inspired polish bring classic shooter action into the modern era.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arcade-style combat</strong> \u2013 smooth physics-driven movement and responsive controls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bullet hell intensity</strong> \u2013 dodge intricate enemy patterns and survive overwhelming odds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Protect &amp; survive</strong> \u2013 defend ground targets from bombing waves and kamikaze strikes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic levels</strong> \u2013 turn zones, looping stages, and cinematic hyperspace jumps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shield mechanics</strong> \u2013 deploy or drop shields for tactical defence.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enemy variety</strong> \u2013 scouts, bombers, interceptors, wreckers, and more with unique behaviours.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive audio &amp; VFX</strong> \u2013 layered engine sounds, shield effects, and arcade explosions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scoring &amp; challenge</strong> \u2013 chase high scores, master enemy waves, and prove your skill.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3863270?t=1760770603","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863270/6c16d332777f8f547ad2940a250c77ba5e8789a9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760770603","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.stea